<main class="zd-faq">

  <section class="zdfaq-hero">
    <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
    <h1>Questions about Ziyu Development, Goal Grower, and support.</h1>
    <p>
      Clear answers about the projects, beta testing, purchases, support, and how Ziyu Development is being built.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdfaq-layout">

    <aside class="zdfaq-sidebar">
      <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">Categories</p>
      <a href="#general">General</a>
      <a href="#goal-grower">Goal Grower</a>
      <a href="#beta">Beta Testing</a>
      <a href="#support">Support</a>
      <a href="#orders">Orders</a>
    </aside>

    <div class="zdfaq-content">

      <section id="general" class="zdfaq-group">
        <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">General</p>

        <details open>
          <summary>What is Ziyu Development?</summary>
          <p>Ziyu Development is a small app and product brand building intentional technology for focus, growth, reflection, and real-life improvement.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What kinds of projects are being built?</summary>
          <p>The main project right now is Goal Grower. Other concepts include MyJourney, Blokkr, KindLitt, and current experiments.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Are all of the apps available right now?</summary>
          <p>No. Goal Grower is the main app in development. Some features are ready for testing, while other apps are still concepts or future projects.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section id="goal-grower" class="zdfaq-group">
        <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">Goal Grower</p>

        <details>
          <summary>What is Goal Grower?</summary>
          <p>Goal Grower is a gamified goal and habit tracker where each goal becomes a plant in your garden.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What are shared gardens?</summary>
          <p>Shared gardens let multiple people work on goals together in one shared accountability space.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What happens if I do not water a goal?</summary>
          <p>If you do not keep up with a goal, the plant can start to fade or die. The goal is to make progress feel visual and motivating.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section id="beta" class="zdfaq-group">
        <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">Beta Testing</p>

        <details>
          <summary>How do I become a beta tester?</summary>
          <p>You can apply on the Beta Access page. Beta testers help test features, report bugs, and improve the app before launch.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Do beta testers get access immediately?</summary>
          <p>Not always. Access may be limited depending on the current stage of development, device support, and testing needs.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Can I join the waitlist for future apps?</summary>
          <p>Yes. The Beta Access page includes a future app waitlist for projects like MyJourney, Blokkr, KindLitt, and experiments.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section id="support" class="zdfaq-group">
        <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">Support</p>

        <details>
          <summary>What does support help fund?</summary>
          <p>Support helps cover development time, hosting, tools, design work, product samples, testing, and launch preparation.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Does supporting guarantee a finished product?</summary>
          <p>No. Support helps fund the development process, but it does not guarantee a specific product, reward, timeline, or outcome.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Can I support without buying something?</summary>
          <p>Yes. You can support by sharing the project, joining the community, testing apps, or following development updates.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section id="orders" class="zdfaq-group">
        <p class="zdfaq-eyebrow">Orders</p>

        <details>
          <summary>Where can I shop products?</summary>
          <p>You can browse the All Products page for available products, merch, support items, digital products, and future collections.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Are products connected to the apps?</summary>
          <p>Some products are directly connected to Ziyu apps, while others support the broader mission of intentional technology.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Who do I contact about an order?</summary>
          <p>Use the Contact page for order questions, support questions, or product issues.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

    </div>

  </section>

</main>

